    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes profile discrete measurements of dissolved inorganic carbon (DIC), total alkalinity, pH on total scale, temperature, salinity, oxygen nutrients and CFCs obtained during the R/V Ryofu Maru cruise RF16-06 (EXPOCODE 49UP20160703) along GO-SHIP Section P09 in the Pacific Ocean from 2016-07-03 to 2016-08-24. The cruise started from the south of Honshu, Japan, and sailed towards south along approximately 137\u00c2\u00b0E meridian. This line (WHP-P9) was observed by JMA in 1994 as WOCE (World Ocean Circulation Experiment) Hydrographic Programme and in 2010 as CLIVAR (Climate Variability and Predictability Project) / GO-SHIP (Global Ocean Ship-based Hydrographic Investigations Program).",
